# uv / Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/

# Everything extracted or downloaded: .cache/game/ holds files unpacked and
# decompiled from the game install (`mise run extract`) and must never be
# committed; .cache/handbook/ is the NMS-Handbook fallback (`mise run fetch`).
# Only the normalised data/ output is committed.
.cache/
.cache/game/

# Generated by `mise run web-data`; the Pages workflow rebuilds them.
web/data.json
web/pdf/
web/img/
# ...and the markdown version of the site, written beside it by the same export.
web/md/
web/llms.txt
web/llms-full.txt
web/sitemap.xml
web/robots.txt

# The Svelte site: npm packages, and the build `mise run web-build` deploys.
node_modules/
dist/

# Pictures and texts taken from the game: never committed (they are Hello Games', and mise run extract writes them from your own
# install). web/icons/ holds the item pictures, web/lang/ + web/languages.json the game's texts in every language it ships,
# web/wiki.json what the Wiki page reads.
web/icons/
web/lang/
web/languages.json
web/wiki.json

# The Android build (apk/README.md): the APK is a build output, not source.
apk/*.apk
apk/node_modules/
